This work covers the manuscript (P22_revised.pdf) and the CSV data files in csv/. You may share and adapt the material for any purpose, including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether changes were made.

The CSV data were reduced from the SCDM run of the Virgo Consortium (Jenkins et al. 1998; Frenk et al. 2000). The preprint is arXiv:2201.12665; no journal version exists.
